# Every other page is a file the build writes: index.html, hvdc.html,
# pipeline.html, a page for each station and one for each generator's history,
# generator/<name>/historic.html (see app/build/pages.ts). Anything
# else gets 404.html. A station added to the API since the last build has no
# page until the next, which runs daily (see pages-deployment.yaml). A rewrite
# can't fall back to the app for it: Pages applies rewrites before its files,
# so /generator/* would hide every station's page.
#
# Old links. Rewrites go to / rather than /index.html, which Pages redirects to /.
